 "name": "Board Finance Committee",
 "is_closed": false,
 "creation-date": "2023-01-10",
 "description": "<p>The W3C Board Finance Committee assists the Board in fulfilling its oversight responsibilities to hold the Consortium to account regarding:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li>On-going financial viability;\r\n    <li>Financial budgets and the availability of all analysis relevant to Consortium finances;\r\n    <li>Internal controls and financial/accounting processes;\r\n    <li>Accuracy and timeliness of financial statements.\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Learn more in the <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/2022/10/bod-finance.html\">Finance Committee charter</a>.</p>",
